(text "Eight PWM outputs on a 3-row 2.54 mm block: signal / SERVO_5V / GND. No series resistors - 3.3 V logic straight\nfrom the RP2354B, which is what servos and ESCs expect." (at 15 10 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid 283f3893-1755-53ea-ba70-c6ca851bda8b))
