(text "3.3 V logic; servo/ESC power is the external BEC bus, 3 A limit is the BEC's." (at 15 120 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid 2e469430-e613-52e0-8eaa-a84eaec27e52))
(text "Row 2 is SERVO_5V = the 5V_IN net, i.e. the J3 input BEFORE U25 (the TPS2121 priority power mux). Servo and ESC\ncurrent therefore never crosses the board rails, V5_SYS or the mux; in particular it is not counted against the\nmux ILM current limit (1.49 A, set by R46). It returns through the row 3 ground pins.\nNothing on this sheet loads V3V3_SYS or USB_VBUS." (at 15 140 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid bb8d9f87-bea0-5648-b1fa-8bbac3429aca))
(text "No 3-row generic connector symbol or 2.54 mm 3x08 footprint ships with this KiCad install, so the header is drawn\nas three stacked Conn_01x08 symbols (J12 signal, J13 SERVO_5V, J14 GND) with three 1x08 footprints. Place them on\n2.54 mm centres to form the usual 3x8 servo block; column n is J12 pin n / J13 pin n / J14 pin n." (at 15 165 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid d61f8fd3-c411-5a53-8835-7a515a71c674))
(text "PWM MAP\nPWM1 = GPIO2   PWM5 = GPIO10\nPWM2 = GPIO3   PWM6 = GPIO11\nPWM3 = GPIO4   PWM7 = GPIO14\nPWM4 = GPIO5   PWM8 = GPIO15" (at 15 195 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid 15fbc7c8-1382-532b-ae40-e2b2557b49d2))
(embedded_fonts no))
